Implement TelescopeON command orchestration using TANGO Controls.

Requirements:
- TelescopeON is invoked on CentralNode
- CentralNode invokes TelescopeON on CSPMaster and SDPMaster using DeviceProxy
- Create seperate attribute CommandStatus to track command execution status
- Wait for CommandStatus OK from all devices
- Return OK only if all devices return ResultCode.OK
- Return FAILED if any device fails or times out
- Add logging, exception handling, and timeout handling
- Return immediate response as a QUEUED of CommandStatus
- Generate production-style TANGO Python implementation